&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong product judgment and an instinct for what users want&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background as a software engineer or ability to work deeply with engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with payments, fintech, or in a high-bar finance role (e.g., investing, banking)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of delivering 0→1 products that generate measurable financial results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical thinking; can model impact and drive decisions with data (SQL or similar is a plus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extreme ownership and urgency - ships fast, iterates constantly, and fixes broken experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bias toward outcomes - knows how to set and hit aggressive goals&lt;/li&gt;
